{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"api_issues","type":"text","text":"# 🟡 API & Workflow Inconsistencies\n\n### 1. Reactivation Broken Across All Modules (`app.js:863`)\n- Sends `&action=reactivate` instead of `&restore=1`.\n- Clicking Reactivate deactivates records again!\n\n### 2. Stock Receiving Rejects Partial Deliveries (`stock_receiving.php:40`)\n- UI says *\"adjust for short/partial deliveries\"*.\n- Backend strictly requires exact total ordered quantity or throws 409.\n\n### 3. Role Module Deadlock (`api/role.php:47-89`)\n- `allowedRoleNames()` only permits 4 seeded roles.\n- Adding new roles returns 400; editing returns 409.\n\n### 4. PO Table Actions Missing (`app.js:1265`)\n- Actions column is left completely blank; cancel endpoint unreachable from UI.\n\n[[04_API_&_Schema_Mismatches|Detailed API Report]]","x":1040,"y":-930,"width":520,"height":380,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"sec_vulns","type":"text","text":"# 🔴 Critical Security Vulnerabilities\n\n### 1. Hardcoded Password Backdoor (`api/auth.php:121-139`)\n- If login fails, accepts passwords: `'password123!'`, `'admin123'`, `'123456'`, `'admin'`, or username.\n- Auto-overwrites target user's password in MySQL!\n- **Impact**: Instant account takeover for ANY user.\n\n### 2. First Name Login Hijack (`api/auth.php:15-18`)\n- Queries `WHERE LOWER(username)=:u OR LOWER(first_name)=:f`.\n- **Impact**: Non-unique first names cause account collision.\n\n[[02_Critical_Security_Vulnerabilities|Detailed Security Report]]","x":160,"y":-1100,"width":500,"height":340,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"fe_crashes","type":"text","text":"# 🟠 Fatal Frontend Runtime Errors\n\n### 1. Product Add/Edit Crash (`app.js:436, 449`)\n- Queries `product_unit_measure`, `product_unit_price`, `product_reorder_level`.\n- Real DOM IDs: `unit_measure`, `unit_price`, `reorder_level`.\n- **Error**: `TypeError: Cannot read properties of null (reading 'value')`.\n\n### 2. Supplier Add/Edit Crash (`app.js:513, 525`)\n- Queries `supplier_contact_person`, `supplier_phone`, `supplier_email`.\n- Real DOM IDs: `contact_person`, `phone`, `email`. Drops `address`.\n- **Error**: `TypeError: Cannot read properties of null`.\n\n### 3. Product ↔ Supplier Link Crash (`app.js:611`)\n- Reads `link_notes` (does not exist in HTML).\n- Real DOM ID: `supplier_unit_cost`.\n\n[[03_Fatal_Frontend_Runtime_Errors|Detailed Frontend Errors]]","x":-680,"y":-930,"width":520,"height":380,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"data_engine","type":"text","text":"# 🔵 Transaction & Inventory Engine\n\n### Real-Time Dynamic Stock Formula\n`Stock = (Received + Restocked + Adj.Add) - (Released + Vendor Return + Adj.Ded)`\n\n- **Pessimistic Concurrency**: Uses `FOR UPDATE` on product rows.\n- **Audit Trails**: Logs all actor actions in `audit_log`.\n- **Rate Limiting**: 5 failed logins locks account/IP for 15 mins.\n- **CSRF Token**: Validated on every mutating HTTP verb.\n\n[[01_Architecture_&_Data_Flow|View Data Flow Architecture]]","x":-680,"y":-250,"width":520,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"hub","type":"text","text":"# 🏢 Warehouse Inventory System\n### Full System & Error Review Hub\n\n**Components**:\n- **Frontend**: Vanilla JS (ES6+), Axios, Bootstrap 5 UI\n- **Backend**: PHP 8.x PDO REST APIs, Session Auth, CSRF, RBAC\n- **Database**: MySQL InnoDB (`warehouse_inventory_db`)\n\n[[00_Project_Overview_&_Graph_Hub|Open Review Hub]]","x":200,"y":-250,"width":460,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ui_design_node","type":"text","text":"# 🎨 UI Design & Table Layout (Zero CSS)\n\n### Why Tables Felt Compressed\n1. **Flex Item Collapse**: `#appShell` had an injected `display: flex !important` which collapsed child `.d-flex vh-100` and `<main>` to content width.\n2. **Users Column Inversion**: Column 1 was 'Name' with username data; Column 2 was 'Username' with full name data.\n\n### Pure Bootstrap 5 Fix (No CSS)\n- **Zero CSS Applied**: Deleted `css/style.css` and removed all custom `<style>` injections.\n- **Full-Width Block Layout**: Restored native block display on `#appShell`, restoring 100% viewport width to `<main>`.\n- **Table Layout Restored**: Tables naturally expand across full screen with native Bootstrap classes.\n- **Header Alignment**: Corrected 'Username' and 'Full Name' order in Users table.\n\n[[08_UI_Design_Table_Breathing_Room_Fix|View UI Design Fix]]","x":-680,"y":600,"width":520,"height":400,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"session_fix_node","type":"text","text":"# 🔄 Session & Login-Back Loop Fix\n\n### The 'Need to Refresh' Bug Explained\n1. **CSRF Deadlock**: `api/auth.php` required CSRF on login; after logout/expire, new session was empty, throwing 403 `Session expired. Please refresh`.\n2. **Stale Memory**: `handleLogout()` didn't refresh `csrfToken` in JS.\n3. **BFCache Freeze**: Browser Back button restored DOM from cache where `DOMContentLoaded` never fires.\n\n### Remediation Applied\n- Stripped `requireCsrf()` from login endpoint.\n- Re-initialized clean guest session + CSRF token on logout.\n- Added `pageshow` & `popstate` listeners for instant back/forward sync.\n- **Result**: Zero F5/refresh ever needed!\n\n[[07_Session_Lifecycle_&_Login_Back_Fix|View Session Analysis]]","x":1080,"y":-130,"width":480,"height":340,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"refresh_persistence_node","type":"text","text":"# 🔄 Page Refresh & Session Persistence\n\n### Why Refresh Kicked Back to Login\n1. **Unhidden Static HTML**: `#authScreen` was rendered without `hidden` in raw HTML; `#appShell` had `hidden`. Browser painted login card before async JS finished.\n2. **Missing Server Pre-check**: `index.php` served raw HTML without reading `currentUser()`.\n3. **Tab Reset**: `showApp()` unconditionally called `activateTab('dashboard')`.\n4. **Session Lock**: Simultaneous `DOMContentLoaded` + `pageshow` requests blocked PHP file locks.\n\n### 4-Layer Solution Applied\n- **Server-Side Render**: `index.php` checks session; pre-renders sidebar and hides `#authScreen`.\n- **Zero-Latency Head Style**: `<head>` script injects display styles prior to initial paint.\n- **Active Tab Memory**: Saved in `sessionStorage` and restored on reload.\n- **Guarded pageshow**: Checks `e.persisted` to prevent duplicate concurrent queries.\n\n[[07_Session_Lifecycle_&_Login_Back_Fix|View Refresh Fix Details]]","x":1080,"y":600,"width":500,"height":400,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"fixes_node","type":"text","text":"# 🟢 Code Fixes & Implementation Plan\n\n### Immediate Patches Available:\n1. **Auth Hardening**: Strip backdoor and force strict username matching.\n2. **DOM Alignment**: Synchronize input IDs across `app.js` and `index.html`.\n3. **Reactivation Fix**: Transmit `&restore=1` in `toggleStatus()`.\n4. **Role Table Cleanup**: Remove extra `<td>` and align headers.\n5. **PO Actions Implementation**: Add Cancel and View Details buttons.\n\n[[05_Comprehensive_Fixes_&_Code_Diffs|View Complete Source Code Diffs]]","x":200,"y":1120,"width":520,"height":300,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"modular_node","type":"text","text":"# 📦 Modular 1-to-1 Architecture\n\n### Separated by Feature Matching api/\n- **Views (`views/*.html`)**: 16 dedicated HTML view fragments (panels, modals, templates)\n- **Controllers (`js/*.js`)**: 14 dedicated JS controllers (category, product, po, etc.)\n- **Backend (`api/*.php`)**: 13 REST API endpoints\n- **Entry (`index.php`)**: Clean PHP include shell\n\n[[06_Modular_Frontend_Architecture|View Modular Architecture]]","x":-80,"y":280,"width":400,"height":280,"color":"4"}
	],
